            "notes": "## Gameplay Focus This Round\n\nThis is where things get way more spicy. Look at the Build Notes above for your COMBO with Shield Throw, and remember to Chamber it when you can!\n\n##  \ud83c\udfb6 Boostin' Makes Me Feel Gooooood! \ud83c\udfb5\n\nPick up [Omni-Boost](item_632bd990-4523-4b3f-b08a-6dd11280c6f9) around here if you have way more money and have your purple items already - or if  you don't have enough for both purple's, pick it up here. You're going to keep that for awhile as it'll ensure you get  your shield bash damage in and ensures you hit easy Shield Throws.\n\n## If you're getting Harambe'd to death\nUnavoidable damage through your shield? Get this: [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf). We're talking Winston electricity, Junkrat, Ash burn, etc :: Then pick up [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf)",
